==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to take out the first [[Celeboodle]]. Any [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] Ubers with high damage can be useful. This level requires good Awakened Bahamut timing, as the Celeboodles are strong and can prevent you from taking out [[Lord Gravey]].

